        `redlineLabelText` + the accept/reject popover (271-294) already surface `rationale`; extend to lead with rationale and render `confidence_band` as a secondary coarse band + explicit-review affordance.
      </pattern>
      <pattern name="pending-redline selection state" location="src/client/shared/Spaarke.Compose.Components/src/widgets/hooks/usePendingRedline.ts">
        Gate accept-all / pre-selection on `confidence_band` at the selection layer; leave the mark-over-range apply (461-465) untouched.
